Script,Preempt4M
window.currentPBSScenario = 'Preempt4M';
window.currentPBSScenarioFilename = 'Preempt_4M';
console.log('PBS: Logging scenario selection for Preempt4M');
fetch('https://bba.harmonicsystems.com/api/scenario/select', {
    method: 'POST',
    headers: {
        'Content-Type': 'application/json',
        'X-Client-Version': '1.0.0'
    },
    body: JSON.stringify({
        scenario: 'Preempt4M',
        user: whoAmI() || 'anonymous'
    })
}).then(function(r){ console.log('PBS: Server response', r.status); }).catch(function(e){ console.log('PBS: Fetch error', e); });
setDealerCode(`

/*
convention-card-ns: 21GF-DEFAULT
convention-card-ew: 21GF-GIB
auction-filter: Auction.....\n4[HS]
*/
# Preempt 4M
dealer east

### Imported Leveling Code ###
c1 = hascard(west,2C)
c2 = hascard(east,2D)
c3 = hascard(west,3C)
c4 = hascard(east,3D)

keep06 = c1 and c2          // this is used later w/c3 & c4 expressions
keep44 = c3 or c4           // this is used later w/c1 & c2 expressions

keep015 = keep06 and c3
keep03 = keep06 and keep44
keep045 = keep06 and not c3
####06 = c1 and c2
keep11 = c1 and keep44
keep14 = c1 and not keep44
keep19 = c1 and not c2
keep25 = c1
keep30 = keep06 or c3
keep33 = c1 or (c2 and keep44)
####44 = c3 or c4
keep47 = keep44 or keep06

keep53 = not keep47
keep56 = not keep44
keep67 = not keep33
keep70 = not keep30
keep75 = not keep25
keep81 = not keep19
keep86 = not keep14
keep89 = not keep11
keep94 = not keep06
keep955 = not keep045
keep97 = not keep03
keep985 = not keep015
keep   = 1
keep0  = 0
### End of Imported Leveling Code ###

tp = hcp(east)
sp = hcp(east,spades)
hp = hcp(east,hearts)

# Semi-solid: 2 of the top 3 honors plus at least one of the jack or ten
eS = spades(east)>7 and top3(east,spades)>1 and top5(east,spades)>2 and hearts(east)<4
eH = hearts(east)>7 and top3(east,hearts)>1 and top5(east,hearts)>2 and spades(east)<4

# Preemptive values -- most of the strength sits in the long suit
sValues = eS and 2 * sp > tp
hValues = eH and 2 * hp > tp

ePreempts = (sValues or hValues) and hcp(east)>6 and hcp(east)<11

# Level exactly-8 trumps against 9-or-more
eight  = spades(east)==8 or hearts(east)==8
longer = not eight

levelTheDeal = (eight and keep11) or (longer and keep)

ePreempts and levelTheDeal

produce 40
action printoneline,
average "4S opening   " 100 * sValues,
average "4H opening   " 100 * hValues,
average "8-card suit  " 100 * eight,
average "9+ card suit " 100 * longer,
`, "E", true)
Script
Button,Preempt 4M,\n\
--- East opens a 4-level major preempt holding an 8+ card semi-solid heart or spade suit.\n\
Semi-solid means two of the top three honors plus the jack or ten，with most of the\n\
strength in the long suit and fewer than 11 HCP. Half the deals give East exactly 8\n\
trumps and half give 9 or more，so both flavors of the preempt come up equally often.\n\
North and South must decide whether to double，bid on，or pass it out.\n\
%Preempt4M%
